ChatKit-Compose
Copyright 2026 ChatKit-Compose Contributors

This project is an independent, 100% clean-room Jetpack Compose rewrite
inspired by the API ergonomics, model-agnostic interfaces (IUser, IMessage,
IDialog, MessageContentType), and chat UI concepts pioneered by:

  stfalcon-studio/ChatKit
  https://github.com/stfalcon-studio/ChatKit
  Original Copyright 2016 stfalcon.com (Apache License 2.0)

Thank you to the Stfalcon team and all contributors of the original ChatKit
library for helping generations of Android developers build chat UIs cleanly.
ChatKit-Compose exists to give teams an effortless path forward into modern
Jetpack Compose and Material 3 without rewriting their domain models.

